<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila's PHIBOR mostly steady amid stable market.</title>
<headline>Manila's PHIBOR mostly steady amid stable market.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine interbank offered rates (PHIBOR) were mostly steady on Thursday following the stability of rates at the money market, traders said.</p>
<p>Only the two-month rate was slightly lower.</p>
<p>The PHIBOR market, in which banks swap their pesos for dollars, usually mirrors trends at the money market which reflects the daily demand for pesos.</p>
</text>
